e.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Retrieves it.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "A wall phone rings.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Everyone stops.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Vinnie crosses.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Picks up.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yeah.", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it clean?", "name": "ASANTE", "speaker": 3, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["over phone, flat"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Clean.", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Count it again.", "name": "ASANTE", "speaker": 3, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Vinnie covers the receiver.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Looks at Shauntae.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Count it.", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["low"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not mine to count.", "name": "SHAUNTAE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "She folds another towel.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Olek unzips the gym bag.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Cash, bundled.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "He thumbs a stack.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Counts under his breath.", "para": 8, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Forty. Fifty.", "name": "OLEK", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is that Olek I hear?", "name": "ASANTE", "speaker": 3, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's counting.", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Tell him it's short by two.", "name": "ASANTE", "speaker": 3, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Vinnie stares at the phone.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Slowly turns.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's short by two.", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to Olek"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I counted twice.", "name": "OLEK", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's lying.", "name": "SHAUNTAE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am not lying.", "name": "OLEK", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Vinnie hangs up.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Walks toward Olek.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Soft shoes on linoleum.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Where's the two?", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "In my pocket. For rent.", "name": "OLEK", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mm-hm.", "name": "SHAUNTAE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Vinnie grabs Olek's collar.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Slams him into the washer.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "The drum rattles.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Quarters spill.", "para": 11, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Shauntae sets down her towel.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not here.", "name": "SHAUNTAE", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Stay out of it.", "name": "VINNIE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My sister's laundromat.", "name": "SHAUNTAE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "The phone rings again.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody moves.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}